  .use(adminPlugin)   // ← packages/backend/src/api/admin/detection-patterns.ts:33
  ...
```

The plugin is scoped (`{ as: "scoped" }`), meaning it applies to all routes on the router that uses it, but doesn't leak into parent/sibling routers. Routes that don't call `.use(authPlugin)` are unauthenticated by default.

